{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:50865bef2db0194cb85b616d1de5fe00fa40d2dc80fce31c56704942506d3cd2",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2da76e833bf3616fab23ed4b0730ca1de6c3c0875d2b8966269a88c922936584",
      "text": "迈向全新战斗的舞台",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80e043af133bffc29289529d08e5100a651b1242139070bcbc59a2f38e37e874",
      "text": "尾随武等人的脚步来到事务所的涟。\n在那里虽然被询问要不要成为偶像，\n涟还是转身离开了。\n另一边，对于陪武前来听取说明的\n道流，制作人提出了一个惊人的提议。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_a:cmd-000019:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_a:cmd-000019:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2da76e833bf3616fab23ed4b0730ca1de6c3c0875d2b8966269a88c922936584",
      "text": "迈向全新战斗的舞台",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_a:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f132b92030555b6315c888f1705e9b668095e1f866f3a90ecfa1a29a34d1fb46",
      "text": "小不点他们，进到这栋大楼里了吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_a:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49279c87bf706aa703cceadad74ccb21d4b9b37ac2d04481634246d32691271a",
      "text": "这里面到底有什么啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_a:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fcfcb5c4fea3b6b7673d8caa44905ab797068df168f847bf7b78e209faa4661d",
      "text": "可恶，从这里根本看不清里面……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_a:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5bc32f85477cb9083e1e621c2b022dfde3aacce3de3f6ccadff2a29d58da70ae",
      "text": "（都走到这里了再回去也太不甘心了。\n能走到哪就走到哪吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_a:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5783741c5abefcdf1f3fe865d22acba6bf67407dda66c95f82dad3bbabf9bbd7",
      "text": "那些家伙，到底去哪了……是这间房间吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_a:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4dbf48964d1fb2c00eb8eb8c52c70782606aa233f04cc3e1821c6b6c1cd3aa4e",
      "text": "嗯？什么啊这是。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_a:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da7e07adb7c2ffe0886ffc9cde13c39a424667fb9dc9391887b727aa749827cf",
      "text": "三一五Production……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_a:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f13f1640b7ff203ac9f300a8f226ab8a8678530cab6bb87317f34ff83f0487b",
      "text": "念作“最高（315）”Production哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_a:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7f878b8ced1a7957c560d573e30ddbbc1696e38c370513aacbbf4bff12e7f43",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_a:cmd-000158:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c690abf39413177269125fb7e481636ab9005567f4e4dc9fe46f593a0145c283",
      "text": "（切，杂鱼跑来搭话了。\n感觉气息很弱，本大爷才无视的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_a:cmd-000163:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73f6cf50e2da3ef3db3860aa3da9ee533dd97c3119fc767aa3ca222eeb1db95a",
      "text": "（在惹上麻烦事之前，\n赶紧开溜吧……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_b:cmd-000011:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17c6fcec12a1f7f6f21bd33ec27e1d71f0c4ac4d85a4d27033471f044e4aca5d",
      "text": "那个……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_b:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4260fce3a4bac04a2bdf6a2502dea229eaf4bf75f29c754cfebfa9bd6a205a20",
      "text": "啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59c8aa2a5f26d2761935b57c50d791073a9bd7ad56666fb92a2db258db211df2",
      "text": "（哈，一看就是个没用的家伙。\n搞什么啊，这家伙？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a663372e423a840f7686281be9225399c3b1c21cc822fa02d10db42627554b72",
      "text": "别直勾勾地盯着看啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d351de6fa6f75d251406325173ead3ef01c4973b79d7e6b78387c5976a8c8aa3",
      "text": "啊，对不起。你是来参加\n偶像试镜的吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a635ad6a16c82d84666bcbde36db84d372cb39f3c3eee7f90a353aeca95c634",
      "text": "哈啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1e258ea5c7304ee8f7d3925195ee499be8df5a33687bb4d823d3afde7b4fed2",
      "text": "我觉得你的话，绝对能成为偶像！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_b:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df06df7798e263c013a0dcc59099968dbfb9d1a3ff4533897c526fb8e693b469",
      "text": "（什……这家伙在说什么胡话呢！？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_b:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c66b4bb5eb19ff652c351856327ebea36cdf4f289b7295c01e75450e605be2aa",
      "text": "正好现在就要开始说明\n试镜的相关事宜了。方便的话，请进里面来吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_b:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e5af40ecb0d886ec4fcf1c32ae1ccc32c8c3a52a7fd3bc1fabe4a21f7f98883",
      "text": "等等……\n别说些莫名其妙的话！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_b:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27adbcf38dd0b2b233e6537c7f25c74878f978c40aec60d262fd504d9f846733",
      "text": "本大爷才用不着来这种地方呢，给我让开！\n怪人！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_b:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dde6f3ae7208b725ea042ab2f4c2218036cffc3fa8fc47eb39fffe2e5e0e1086",
      "text": "啊……！\n走掉了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_c:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91e2bd5c1cb11b79775c8227620463cfc8df462a17fddf758bfb1d56f12df1fc",
      "text": "照刚才的说明，练习费用和\n各种杂费都由你们这边承担对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_c:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7fff11b8e9eb258a516e2b27e5dbe1b8958e2746c1beb5bbdbbb359290b9512",
      "text": "是的，我们会提供全面的支持！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_c:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4762b07bd8d1ba4c0d84d00b77480c68e2cad107de2e4e8d1501fd00635c5d86",
      "text": "（连偶像出道后的薪酬体制，\n都讲得非常细致深入呢……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_c:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5ef6251b0a5c688e2e66b9949c5b2e16a84dc08a3635647899244900cbdfe30",
      "text": "（好教练不会只谈梦想。\n难以启齿的事，也会开门见山地说出来）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_c:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e94566b97732aa4cb63ee9e9c37bf2eba904ff8b2f6027c05b90038dfef1400",
      "text": "还有其他问题吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_c:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e92850d547b9dbcea02eb78d19c03d58140310c748736adf4940f86f20c0109",
      "text": "没有了……要是托付给你，武的事情\n我觉得可以放心。武你觉得呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_c:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02e6938b9b0ed32c66fb742c8689ca644306e67a76b378cd82d3710cd0404e32",
      "text": "……没问题，我已经下定决心了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_c:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:309631b6f8f072f59684a1b39987d8d1608ddaaec3363e1010d0897606c6c306",
      "text": "这样啊……好！\n武的事，就重新拜托你了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_c:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9aeb1ff479f053075c568933f4add5826f900ea177307a98150415cf050681dc",
      "text": "好的！首先为了试镜，\n请多关照了，武先生！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_c:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0643942a8901e3aa97bc6c1398b47a969d54f8e2c235bf89d48fa35e8fde77c5",
      "text": "嗯，拜托了。\n……圆城寺先生，谢谢你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_d:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03f5bda04b0178fa6e846e35d4243b5de26b92eec07f58ed88382044b68ae1bb",
      "text": "（……找圆城寺先生陪我来真是太好了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_d:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8fcd0b69f31c966edb8af5fac8587994308977d850b5e5b55c97f0c884e47cf8",
      "text": "那，我们这就告辞了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_d:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2855fac9abc21c70fdd34d93867281f53b8c0992ec021685dd6ffedb49cdb524",
      "text": "道流先生，不好意思！\n能再耽搁您一点点时间吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_d:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a4158795f3b56a7b2192bc75ba0f2211b68ddb87b03d4aa26d9b7098143a5b9",
      "text": "嗯，找我？怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_d:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ddb69a9a55977882de29282e396367e4fc22af9c043cc9f5b0b9daa46c45c1c9",
      "text": "道流先生，您要不要也成为偶像呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_d:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e71bbee6960e302d95a6f37b80e11f0f71337cb8754022fac68834188b4c7f8e",
      "text": "哎！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_d:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:752c1797566c2f784ffd292620a4cd6e72fb5862fa25b9876615cef61c5e15e6",
      "text": "偶像！？我吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_d:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9bec3f2a11eaeaaa9b94fb34ef05237d1f3830d8fd7fa1d87500e933786e1a6a",
      "text": "从见面的那一瞬间我就有所感觉，\n经过刚才的交谈，我更加确信了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_d:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e9fc610d10133c3d73a6a5b1a531286babe498729ae6d8024814bf2ff9f882f",
      "text": "在您身上，我也感受到了偶像的潜质。\n要不要和武先生一起参加试镜呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_d:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bed58ab5bd95921614b1455972103a26be1e7aab0f80bf429847c463571bd151",
      "text": "没、没有啦。我身上\n还有拉面店的工作在做……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_d:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a481a3a6a1f7cce1652668a034e7aee4261cf284cfa1a301a9b8aac6ea00db59",
      "text": "兼任偶像也是完全没问题的！\n能不能请您带回去考虑一下呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_d:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:537ed73535b56121a9b4faa84a72f3b442ca57e1a8301398eb6aed6247450ce7",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_d:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c1c961e2b96927aa34007cad77367c168d70e45952a215ade10ebc4e6485b07",
      "text": "（唔——……要是能拿到刚才说的那笔钱，\n买下那栋大楼就有眉目了，但是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_e:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4cc969e683650496ee7b5e55c5b3dfa3fd30283e39d10df4765efdc8e63d21b",
      "text": "（为了拒绝搬离大楼的要求，\n现在很需要一笔大钱）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_e:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00ceea310a3306d62b5ecd2f8920e793c1733ea30adcfd1316122b27b87107e7",
      "text": "（再这样下去，不仅是男道拉面，\n大楼里的大家也都会失去容身之所）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_e:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5799029c942e8c7d67a34ade4abfb36a138842ad32b54be7f4f36250ab00f0f4",
      "text": "……圆城寺先生？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_e:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4deabf0e22ed875607470a7568ea9d3ef0663ed03025dad2126a3596eb7d38aa",
      "text": "……要是成了偶像并且红了的话，\n薪水也会相应增加对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_e:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93a5a79b48bae347aa8d286205ef2ebfed60710735fd13e4bf0770665ac3733e",
      "text": "是的，那是当然！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_e:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92e7bf0fdb7890d6f05c1156c428a782df6ac1b8dee2b95cc6b4e15eda88e754",
      "text": "（成为偶像，赚取大钱吗……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_e:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66bed989ffb00761babc8f24f78b37902dc18bd34b1d64ae5f30c44061670b5b",
      "text": "（也许是个鲁莽的想法。但是，比起什么都不做，\n就算多少有点鲁莽，我也想在这个崭新的世界里搏一把……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_e:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e15ee6fde600804f32bf1ca4b2efebb25e9313668dee72af383fa5d535f487e2",
      "text": "……试镜，我去参加也行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_e:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf8d4957946557ed1b7facb05b179892f5d193b1df45f5d316be29efd117f20",
      "text": "不过，必须允许我在继续经营拉面店的同时\n去当偶像！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_e:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c3e0eab7135bbf0124c363d162784a0708abfe045d94917138ffb36a58b21a3",
      "text": "那是当然！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_e:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fda2f5d7de586880d4ace0896084592475f2643ab5f51a3adaea225b793f3b7",
      "text": "道流先生、武先生。\n再次向二位说一声，请多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_f:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_f:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c49d65cbbb6ecb1ad27e90f321ea48332ea44534e2f38113207022a7f433fe39",
      "text": "喵～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_f:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65ddd5224cffa8492fde2d6f473b3415416abadcd7ee27736ac8261189cab0cb",
      "text": "来，冠军，这是小鱼干。\n好好嚼碎了再吃。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_f:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f07b1e650fe0d7073bf1a0551ebbdb8096f4ea3525d07c3d7934dc0a19978435",
      "text": "冠军？这家伙的名字叫霸王。\n本大爷都说多少遍了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_f:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6bfa65c83d5e93c0bdbe43bda6052275e39cb4cc5a292cbcb1b14a62b9790c0",
      "text": "来，霸王。比起那个小不点的饲料，\n本大爷的饲料更好吃哦。吃吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_f:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1b6bd59a5a3fab2fb4aba791321f08ea18db378ac60b9c5820f1b463f922698",
      "text": "库哈哈！看吧！\n正狼吞虎咽地吃本大爷给的呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_f:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:663a053f727d1c0461d48e1dad588073efb70acb1890a657e08f5e615be8e1dd",
      "text": "（……今天居然没像平时那样找茬啊。\n嘛，安静点也挺好的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_f:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7f878b8ced1a7957c560d573e30ddbbc1696e38c370513aacbbf4bff12e7f43",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_f:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2b9fb7a6e8b995d9295a98844a0dfdc1389acafa96d49ddca37b022a34fc48a",
      "text": "（干什么？这次又死盯着我看。\n……又想挑起决斗吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_f:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a3a7bc0871654f3ea616746b03d51b7638d8e16d7de59ad696f97f0f1388ae9",
      "text": "……喂，偶像到底是什么？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_f:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:998ae0176332896f2d591e274fd4002d4a01756c60644184f87208d9779af506",
      "text": "……嗯？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_f:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:200555714b782e090fa729f96719258e545800551a5cfa73a802edbc1d9da5ba",
      "text": "本大爷问你偶像到底是什么啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_g:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6c514fdcfde4286c51dc7fbb9a7531b47ab04903b28c0b60e12b3e02d83091c",
      "text": "……你是听圆城寺先生说，\n我们要当偶像了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_g:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:acf2e94f1d5d0d2030d5fe4c401a05996909b54b1930aac43ae50fa4a75f76c0",
      "text": "那种事无所谓，快点告诉我！\n偶像到底是什么！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_g:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a635f696640b59e43e7c33f47a249d0cc61859dba976795c22920de7c7bff8f",
      "text": "（……该怎么解释才好啊？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_g:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2c17912707ba56a7f8143364c306a6788fd362db682a6740691c693c62ed933",
      "text": "（这家伙也不可能乖乖听我说话，\n而且我对偶像也还不是很懂……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_g:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7d6e99f3c7ce97c3160b4f6a7a7e512f52c342c81917a7c523990c5330476dc",
      "text": "……详细情况，去问圆城寺先生吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_g:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d3b427c03e43b589ec9182f5b214d5fda640f2a7e9adf183c32451e22983ea6",
      "text": "意思是不肯告诉本大爷吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_g:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1a507646e613d59d02d8b3ee279f7830ea68246499f3c2bb36a425f04bc3d30",
      "text": "很难解释清楚。\n而且你脑子又不好使。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_g:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5c87d10af1b07b115c4f29bf339ec290b8e77a1973dfa1b90d87040fab2510b",
      "text": "什……切！\n算了，跟小不点根本没法沟通！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_g:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c706d09ab8ff57c17a9834903ecfe46624cf3fc3dc31f97eaffd3d3edb4360e",
      "text": "搞什么啊……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_g:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a6717954b7acdbc55f0400fb34672827627770fee022203dd4507b43d5fdbcf",
      "text": "那家伙今天格外反常呢，冠军。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_g:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61db2ba9cdce6eb5e709fb5b99882435553135464706ad0ee2256baa78af6f0f",
      "text": "喵？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_h:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:667e2507e40be390049d40a2b9e74f2175fc662bef189618570db53a18240782",
      "text": "道流的家",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_h:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3264c9714c566b136eccba88484228a7266f553ed51abe86154b126350ac494d",
      "text": "涟居然会来我家，真稀奇啊。\n随便坐吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_h:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd2d874ac1ea8d08f86d5b7ae1064a04a5a705a1e0d8edf81515609c9faf314b",
      "text": "……啊？这布偶是什么玩意儿？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_h:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2dd4adc0c90a185d830f0ff9799aa93c4b51eb967f4f6db109ab852d24b0797",
      "text": "不是布偶，是编织玩偶啦。\n看，用这个毛线织出来的哦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_h:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1fa67d5bbe3451d11cab6fba174c5524cb9eca4dd78cc89ad1b0b1e1fa95e5ba",
      "text": "哪个都无所谓。\n比起那个……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_h:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95d69a8e131792a58ec88097942681e5e30f45fdd81516cd4ce9f7ec4fd3051a",
      "text": "偶像，到底是个什么东西啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_h:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25c945a1c82c1c7fd5898aab96a68885ef54978fda0c2058e03c7e15c6e22286",
      "text": "啊，难道是从武那里听说的？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_h:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3f0f146689722396751a4926b71370d5960d3bd98dda7b293b9695f4fa62edc",
      "text": "～～！小不点和拉面店的都说一样的话！\n废话少说，快点给我解释清楚！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_h:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70e248d4d57de8826103be7fef3cf00a23f48eb7e3d4d8b14fa76b75fd90240f",
      "text": "唔。其实我自己也还没能\n完全掌握全部就是了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_h:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:32582501427d83c46f3d400e9e466410ffa1f8f4ee4aba27e78ce43dd77aaf51",
      "text": "偶像好像是唱歌、跳舞，\n做各种各样事情的职业。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_h:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7550b9de21f879f4c4419ba57c0d95d331d2e3a001ee1b8fa190c613d25d885",
      "text": "然后我和武，\n决定在这个作为偶像的领域去决一胜负了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_h:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2fe6f2fe5727597be43d6ae4c19c78927c93ef95acd88b0a9235a37b8cc60da2",
      "text": "目标是大舞台！不过，首先为了\n成为偶像，我们得去挑战试镜才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_i:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84fbbe7a9d8eb9c83c72ef662a9c6416431decb444bc7ae404917508dcd258b8",
      "text": "（作为偶像决胜负？试镜？\n果然，完～全听不懂）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_i:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b1d569f5fd9e6a283e409aecb7af20c2e9939ce378f0784589ca11d8322b39a",
      "text": "（不过，拉面店的每次都能轻而易举地制止本大爷和小不点的决斗，是个不可小觑的家伙……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_i:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ed89f848d8522b0f78237b53258207b3e63c3891ef7e0fb5ebeb3493c3c25e4",
      "text": "（连这种家伙都摆出这么认真的表情去战斗的世界……那就是偶像吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_i:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7f878b8ced1a7957c560d573e30ddbbc1696e38c370513aacbbf4bff12e7f43",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_i:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d3e855a3aad1c0b6d064a8feec17338215262485691b04f15e2be0f3840a135",
      "text": "涟？\n怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_i:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0359939df72cb6ea9b026135974e4fd5ffa04337b2223015d8cfcbca993a4785",
      "text": "（小不点和拉面店的，\n都打算在本大爷不知道的世界里战斗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_i:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40029bc6e475926f860854a92768ab4818b8ddb9e447346dad1a83624759c383",
      "text": "（这边明明胜负都还没分出来……\n切，真让人火大！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_i:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:922d4e6a5773d97552e8c6e96a8141e6f31641c258a8d623b94b60977ed98945",
      "text": "（……啊？不过等等。\n说起来本大爷那时候也……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_i:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1e258ea5c7304ee8f7d3925195ee499be8df5a33687bb4d823d3afde7b4fed2",
      "text": "我觉得你的话，绝对能成为偶像！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_i:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df06df7798e263c013a0dcc59099968dbfb9d1a3ff4533897c526fb8e693b469",
      "text": "（什……这家伙在说什么胡话呢！？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_i:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ff4bec90c8ec21b281ee7bb1aff28327d4d9b436ac4e28100558c9a48466ed8",
      "text": "……在你们进去的大楼里，\n有个奇怪的家伙也对本大爷说过“能成为偶像”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_i:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:faa1a9e14572304582f8c0d323670d160a6493fe0d21fc6e682e7a66c620a23a",
      "text": "也就是说，本大爷也能在那个偶像的世界里战斗……\n是因为看出来本大爷有这么强吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_j:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fdee2af61f9b44c61d679ebd2b3a0fe6753b74366ba5eb1a378e25047544cb71",
      "text": "奇怪的家伙？\n难道，涟也被那个人发掘了吗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_j:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e44949c3523fed282828242dfff044b1bd5098bbd0c9e4cb09e15b7e40969f5",
      "text": "虽然不知道是哪根葱，\n但念叨着什么315 Pro之类的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_j:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce17e450fb64cb6285b6b6b61641636819e4be21a095d9959dc3fbfba39245f0",
      "text": "（涟那天跟踪我们了吗。\n都没注意到啊。……不对，比起这个）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_j:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4fb2d01f115b689c348d10cc5e43736df1467804d24f8cccb2647cc143f103c",
      "text": "（如果涟也成了偶像……毫无疑问，\n肯定会像以往那样向武发起挑战吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_j:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:072e15b199bb875f9ce20fe151a5de2379feb625399ba017dd91c3e24ce1b500",
      "text": "（但是，如果在同一个队伍里战斗的话会怎样？\n……也许能建立起和现在截然不同的关系）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_j:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15c3ec796df404c4a26b8d6a687b27f458078d163a4df43a9af205ccfdd2007d",
      "text": "……涟。以超越武的偶像为目标，\n不也是和打倒武是一样的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_j:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79003c6220918359b46b8a7a757f4771f944e9b09f3e527aaa354463157c4145",
      "text": "啊啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_j:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7679f1f529e008e973712df90569a7701c0450a9283accb1ee505871d601c76d",
      "text": "接下来武会\n在偶像的世界里认真决胜负。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_j:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d43a3632d4fda60950863c05ba7128c5d63f6dadcd5d50c9ed7198c74b09abdb",
      "text": "涟要是也成为偶像的话，\n就能和那么认真的武一决高下了哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_j:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18022cf3021fb5a73464a9a89ee3f31c1bfa8b96922379f5333e52515a3c59b3",
      "text": "能和小不点，动真格地战斗……？\n……哈，那不正合我意吗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_j:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:44b5f7fd6c1b3ac39846eeb026e5d856a86e2fad68a3c95ca3f45b9d465256f2",
      "text": "管他是偶像还是什么，\n本大爷肯定比小不点更强！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_j:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9255484ff43b0e7be53b41657a84a5dbc52ae9928ee2c037ccd31bdeb008839",
      "text": "本大爷也要当偶像，把小不点给打趴下！\n所以……带本大爷去那个试镜！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
